P("    electric limit is NOT a function of the electric data alone.  Two sectors whose flux")
P("    strings are identical as seen from S differ by a full bit, and what separates them lives")
P("    in the MAGNETIC term.  EM (the Gauss law) fixes which configurations exist, the charge")
P("    fixes that there are several, and the magnetic coupling decides whether they stay")
P("    superposed.  Each of the three is necessary and none is sufficient -- the same")
P("    non-separability BLOCK 14 measured, reached from an independent direction.")


det = [o for o in sorted(tab) if max(tab[o]) - min(tab[o]) < 1e-5]
und = [o for o in sorted(tab) if max(tab[o]) - min(tab[o]) >= 1e-5]
P(">>> READ THE TABLE HONESTLY, INCLUDING THE ROW THAT BREAKS IT.")
P("    ORDERS %s ARE FULLY DETERMINED: every sector at those orders gives the same H_FULL to 1e-5"
  % det)
P("       -- order 1 and order 3 give a FULL BIT, order 5 gives ZERO.  %d of %d sectors."
  % (sum(len(tab[o]) for o in det), sum(len(tab[o]) for o in tab)))
P("    ORDER %s IS NOT: its %d sectors span [%.9f , %.9f], the whole range."
  % (und, sum(len(tab[o]) for o in und), min(min(tab[o]) for o in und), max(max(tab[o]) for o in und)))
